      "impact": "A user escalating without careful working tree inspection may git add and commit intermediate state, introducing unresolved findings or scope violations into the branch history. The risk is higher when the user escalates after a gap in time (e.g., returning to the branch hours later) and the dirty state is not immediately obvious from git status alone.",
